   performs NO HTTP. PedalReading parses pedal_position / brake_pedal_position / brake_pedal_active
   (null-tolerant; numeric-string accepted; NaN/Infinity rejected; bool only for brake-active).
 - Layout: glass panel + "Pedal Usage" title + 3-up row: Throttle radial gauge (cyan, token TsChartRegenBrush
   = #06B6D4 == web #06b6d4) over "Throttle Position"; Brake radial gauge (red, TsChartTemperatureBrush
   = #EF4444 == web #ef4444) over "Brake Pedal Position"; decorative pedal icon + danger/success
   "Brake Active"/"Brake Inactive" badge over "Brake Pedal Status". Web hasAny -> Ready; !hasAny -> Empty
   ("No pedal telemetry received yet"). Gauge value clamp [0,100], unit '%' present / em-dash absent, and the
   integer-or-global-precision rule are reproduced 1:1 and unit-tested.
 - States (all render, none hidden): Loading (skeleton), Ready, Empty, Error (TsQueryError + retry), Stale
   (stale chip), Offline (offline chip). VM state matrix + projection + JSON adapter + result mapper unit-tested.
