   brakeActive/brakeInactive/brakePedal/pedalNoData) already exist in Strings/{en,he,ar}/Resources.resw and
   apps/shared/i18n/catalog. Native-only contract-state keys (common.loading/offline/retry/stale and
   dynamics.pedalError[.auth/.offline]) resolve via the ILocalizer English fallback, exactly as the sibling
